        /**
         * Job-processing backend (the oral-transcription API server)
         * @param string $backend_server Base URL of the oral-transcription API (e.g. http://<api-host>:5050).
         *                               Undefined /api/* routes are proxied here, and job-start requests
         *                               are POSTed to <backend_server>/api/job/<job_type>.
         * @param string $apiKey Plaintext key sent to the transcription API as the `apiKey` header.
         *                       The API stores only its MD5 hash (api_key_hash in its config.ini).
         * @param string $api_key Bearer key that job workers must present when POSTing status
         *                        updates to /updates/... (checked in ProcessController::updateJob()).
